@title EMC fix-it: preview a painted-plate fix, see what it clears, apply it
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Check > EMC check lists each finding with "Preview: <fix>" for the fixes the program can do. The preview works on a copy: it names the findings it clears, any it brings and the risk change, with Apply (one undo step) and Cancel. The fixture has a drive on a painted plate (EMC-11). The pictures are the evidence for the card layout (drawn text).
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "EMC check"
scroll 360 400 -300
wait 10
expect "Preview: Scrape the mounting area bare"
shot 01-findings-with-preview-buttons
check_layout
click_text "Preview: Scrape the mounting area bare" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Clears EMC-11"
expect "Apply (one undo step)"
expect "Never compliance"
shot 02-preview-card
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)"
wait 15
expect "Plate finish stated as bare"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 03-applied
check_layout
